# ~/.claude now lives in meta (envctl/home/.claude) — ~/.claude holds only symlinks INTO here
# (ADR-0006 meta portability: everything meta uses lives in meta; globals are symlinks into meta).
#
# Everything physically lives in meta. This file governs only what is COMMITTED: the agent CONFIG
# (behavior — tracked) vs machine-local STATE / caches / SECRETS (present in-meta, never committed).
# CONTENTS-FORM only — each rule names a specific child, so no excluded parent hides a tracked path
# (same discipline as the .handoff durability policy).
#
# TRACKED config (NOT ignored, stay committed): CLAUDE.md, RTK.md, settings.json(.tmpl),
# statusline-command.sh, commands/, hooks/, rules/, skills/, agents/.

# --- secrets (NEVER commit) ---
/.credentials.json
/mcp-needs-auth-cache.json

# --- machine-local state + caches (rebuilt per machine; some enormous, e.g. projects/ ~79G) ---
/projects/
/sessions/
/session-env/
/session-env.tar.xz
/history.jsonl
/shell-snapshots/
/paste-cache/
/file-history/
/downloads/
/chrome/
/ide/
/cache/
/telemetry/
/stats-cache.json
/backups/
/plans/
/tasks/
/teams/
/.last-cleanup
/.last-update-result.json

# --- installed plugin packages (63M; re-installable, not source) ---
/plugins/

# --- editor/settings backups ---
/settings.json.bak
/settings.json.bak.*
/settings.json.weave.bak
